{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><figure><img src=\"https://cdn3.am730.com.hk/processed/2022-06/1061801/block/singleImage/3256731/df/%E8%9E%A2%E5%B9%95%E6%93%B7%E5%8F%96%E7%95%AB%E9%9D%A2%202022-06-13%20185627_0.png?updatedAt=1793699047\"/><figcaption>葵涌葵芳邨22歲男墮樓，送院不治。(資料圖片)</figcaption></figure><p>今日 (3 日 ) 上午 9 時 46 分，警方接獲保安報案，指發現一名男子倒臥在葵涌葵芳邨葵明樓對開，懷疑他從高處墮下。 人員接報到場，該名 22 歲姓林男子昏迷被送往仁濟醫院治理，其後被證實死亡。經初步調查，相信事主從上址一單位墮下。警方於現場沒有檢獲遺書，死因有待驗屍後確定。據悉，事主受精神疾病困擾。</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-03T10:42:08.798557+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":178,"images":1,"source":"am730","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-03T09:44:06+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-03T22:58:17.733150+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-03T10:38:30.745573+00:00","content_hash":"bf9f08eae575312d9c0cfe2ff4e8fd4612e8a2bea3b1c4ffe5286c3f1396b8ac","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":{"scraped_at":"2026-11-03T10:42:08.798557+00:00","latest_fallback":"rss-budget","latest_error":null},"content_capture":null}